				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῷα εὐθαλῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					902.15
				</span></i>
			 (V <i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>): metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ εὐ. [τῆς
